<BaseLayout lang="en" title="37500 Yens — Astero | Bruit Sourd Press" description="Official press kit for 37500 Yens — Astero, first vinyl edition out September 25, 2026." image="/images/astero-cover.jpg"><Header lang="en" switchPath="/37500-yens/"/><main>
<section class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden"><img src="/images/astero-cover.jpg" alt="37500 Yens — Astero" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" data-parallax/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="relative mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-[1600px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-36 md:px-8 md:pb-24"><div class="kicker mb-5">Bruit Sourd presents</div><h1 class="display">37500<br/>YENS</h1><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/40 px-3 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[.12em]">Astero</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/40 px-3 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[.12em]">First vinyl edition</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/40 px-3 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[.12em]">09.25.2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1600px] gap-12 px-5 py-24 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.9fr] lg:py-36"><div class="reveal"><div class="kicker mb-6 text-white/45">2007 / 2026</div><h2 class="section-title">Almost 20 years later.</h2></div><div class="reveal space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75"><p>In 2007, Reims-based duo 37500 Yens released <em>Astero</em> through Distile Records: eight instrumental tracks suspended between noise rock, math rock, repetition, tension and deconstruction.</p><p>After touring extensively across France and sharing stages with Zu, Joe Lally and Explosions in the Sky, 37500 Yens established a sound that was at once physical, exacting and fiercely free.</p><p>On September 25, 2026, <em>Astero</em> finally receives its first vinyl edition, accompanied by three previously unreleased digital bonus tracks from a second album that remained in the vaults.</p></div></section>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-5 pb-24 md:px-8"><img src="/images/37500-live.jpg" alt="37500 Yens live" class="reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl grayscale"/></section>
<section class="rule mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-36"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3"><blockquote class="reveal border-l border-white/40 pl-6 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">“A revelation.”<span class="mt-4 block text-xs uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-white/45">Perte & Fracas</span></blockquote><blockquote class="reveal border-l border-white/40 pl-6 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">“Astero sets the bar high...”<span class="mt-4 block text-xs uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-white/45">XSilence</span></blockquote><blockquote class="reveal border-l border-white/40 pl-6 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight">“Powerful and controlled.”<span class="mt-4 block text-xs uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-white/45">Metalorgie</span></blockquote></div></section>
<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1600px] gap-12 px-5 py-24 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:py-36"><img src="/images/37500-duo.jpg" alt="37500 Yens" class="reveal w-full grayscale"/><div class="reveal"><div class="kicker mb-6 text-white/45">The ghost second album</div><h2 class="section-title">The magic never happened twice.</h2><div class="mt-9 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70"><p>After <em>Astero</em>, the band tried to recreate the singular recording process behind the first album: microphones everywhere, capturing the room, the amplifiers, the drums, the air and the accidents.</p><p>The songs were strong - including one featuring Sascha Andres of Heliogabale - but the sound kept slipping away. Attempts accumulated, life moved on and perfectionism took over. The record remained unfinished.</p><p>Three of those songs now accompany the vinyl as digital bonus tracks: traces of a story left hanging for almost twenty years.</p></div></div></section>
<AudioPlayer tracks={tracks} lang="en" title=" "/>
<section class="rule mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-36"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.9fr]"><div><div class="kicker mb-5 text-white/45">Tracklist</div><h2 class="section-title">Astero.</h2></div><ol class="space-y-3 text-xl text-white/70"><li>01 — 37501</li><li>02 — Astero</li><li>03 — Microphonie</li><li>04 — Chapitres</li><li>05 — Canard boiteux</li><li>06 — Intérieur 1</li><li>07 — Intérieur 2</li><li>08 — The Sullivan's Quartet</li><li class="pt-4 text-white">+ 3 previously unreleased digital bonus tracks</li></ol></div></section>
<section class="rule mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-36"><div class="max-w-5xl"><div class="kicker mb-6 text-white/45">Press kits</div><p class="section-title">Download.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/downloads/37500Yens-PressKit-EN.zip" class="btn" download>Download complete press kit ↓</a><a href="/downloads/37500Yens-PressKit-EN.pdf" class="btn">English PDF</a><a href="/downloads/37500Yens-PressKit-FR.pdf" class="btn">French PDF</a><a href="/downloads/37500Yens-PressKit-EN.docx" class="btn">English DOCX</a><a href="/downloads/37500Yens-PressKit-FR.docx" class="btn">French DOCX</a></div></div></section>
<section class="rule mx-auto max-w-[1600px] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-36"><div class="max-w-5xl"><div class="kicker mb-6 text-white/45">Ann Bonny</div><p class="section-title">Almost twenty years later, they play together again.</p><a href="/en/ann-bonny/" class="btn mt-10">Discover Ann Bonny →</a></div></section>
</main><Footer lang="en"/></BaseLayout>